<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mattel cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mattel cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Hambrecht &amp; Quist analyst Hank Wilson downgraded his recommendation on Mattel Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>- Wilson cited slowing in revenue growth in the fourth quarter, lackluster fourth quarter earnings and the company's decision to restructure to pare away non-core brands due to its inability to generate consistent growth on the top line.</p>
</text>
